OL,3,AMiranda's tears, joy and dance moves
OL,4,Asteal show as deadly boredom sets in on
OL,5,AThe Celebrity Traitors
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,8,Fdetails from episode six of The
OL,9,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,11,FFor a show that likes to keep
OL,12,Fparticipants and viewers on the edges
OL,13,Fof their seats, gripped by suspense and
OL,14,Fskullduggery, it was ironic that
OL,15,FFriday's episode of The Celebrity
OL,16,FTraitors came down to which one of its
OL,17,Fstars would die of boredom.
OL,19,FThe climactic final scene switched
OL,20,Fbetween a series of faces as we waited
OL,21,Fto see which of the famous faithful
OL,22,Fwould... yawn.
